d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Asbury","x":"In addition to moving some projects to next year and eliminating others, we put a hiring freeze in place in March, which has reduced the FTEs by 38 since the end of the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/atlantic-union-bankshares-corporation-aub-q2-2020.aspx"},{"c":"AUB 2020 Q2","e":"aub","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John C. Asbury","x":"In addition to these actions, we're executing on other cost reduction initiatives, such as tighter management to reduce overtime, contract labor and outside consultant spending, requesting pricing concessions from third-party vendors, and renegotiating contracts to include leases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/atlantic-union-bankshares-corporation-aub-q2-2020.aspx"},{"c":"AUB 2020 Q3","e":"aub","d":"2020-10-22","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Laurie Hunsicker","x":"Do you have any movie theater anchored strips?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/atlantic-union-bankshares-corporation-aub-q3-2020/"},{"c":"AUB 2020 Q3","e":"aub","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Asbury","x":"We continue the pilot of our enhanced wealth CRM platform using Black Diamond technology and continue to -- our efforts to rightsize small business clients with the consumer online platform in order to ensure that they're not unnecessarily using a more complex commercial banking solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/atlantic-union-bankshares-corporation-aub-q3-2020/"},{"c":"AUB 2020 Q3","e":"aub","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Asbury","x":"In addition to moving some projects to next year and eliminating others, we put a hiring freeze in place in March, except for critical positions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/atlantic-uni